# Everything in this directory is fetched, never committed.
#
# Only the two documents that describe the corpus are tracked. `cargo xtask corpus fetch`
# puts the PDFs here and checks each one against `MANIFEST.toml`; nothing here should ever
# reach `git add`. Real-world PDFs are frequently under someone else's licence and are often
# large, which is why `*.pdf` is ignored repository-wide.
*
!.gitignore
!MANIFEST.toml
!SOURCES.md